WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.800
It starts with an idea: a landing page for a webinar.

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:12.100
A Project gathers the brief, the brand files and the instructions.

3
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:19.100
